---

This project is an independent, hardware-scaled reimagining of "God's Eye View"
by Bilawal Sidhu & Sameh Khamis (https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view,
MIT). Its CCTV viewer and public-webcam list are adapted from 7h30th3r0n3's
RaspyJack (https://github.com/7h30th3r0n3/Raspyjack). See README.md for full
credits. Live data and imagery are provided by third parties under their own
terms of use.
